translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Potion_Task_Finish_0ad85476:

    e "当然,不过我想他已经知道了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Potion_Task_Finish_735b03ed:

    e "你知道他有多了解你吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Potion_Task_Finish_cde6e4e7:

    o "Ooooky。"

